        <mxCell id="vpce_card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F5;strokeColor=#00A4A6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=70;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;S3 Gateway VPC Endpoint&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #5A6C7D;&quot;&gt;com.amazonaws.ap-southeast-1.s3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #5A6C7D;&quot;&gt;A &lt;b&gt;route-table entry&lt;/b&gt;, not a device &amp;#8212; which is why it is drawn at VPC level and not inside a subnet. $0/hour, $0/GB.&lt;br&gt;Keeps warehouse traffic off the NAT: 1 TB scanned would otherwise cost ~$45 in data processing.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
