        <mxCell id="sm_card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Secrets Manager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #5A6C7D;&quot;&gt;source of truth for every credential&lt;br&gt;read by the &lt;b&gt;setup scripts&lt;/b&gt;, which write a Kubernetes Secret from it — not part of the identity chain&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;no VPC endpoint&lt;/b&gt; — reached via the NAT&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
