        <mxCell id="fn2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6C7D;" value="&lt;b&gt;Read path&lt;/b&gt; (blue): user → ALB → Trino → Polaris → S3 on vended credentials. &lt;b&gt;Write path&lt;/b&gt; (orange): Airflow asks, the operator creates, the driver writes — through the same catalog. The two paths meet nowhere else, which is what makes Polaris the single place access control lives." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="1500" x="60" y="1370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
